scription":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains intense horror themes, frequent jump scares, depictions of fear, and the threat of violent death. Players wear an explosive collar that detonates if time runs out. The atmosphere includes claustrophobic spaces, unsettling audio, and flashing lights, which may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in the basement with Mr HappyFunFace, you have just 60 seconds to complete Dr Vale's punishing &quot;evaluation&quot; before a collar around your neck explodes. The rules are simple - move fast, stay sharp and never look at... <strong><i>him</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/037f34c2bffe3ce988257f2d20dce534.poster.avif?t=1771341083\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/037f34c2bffe3ce988257f2d20dce534.webm?t=1771341083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/037f34c2bffe3ce988257f2d20dce534.mp4?t=1771341083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/a9eaa3c4de82134ccfeea486241368ff.avif?t=1771341083\" width=1560 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Edmund Vale, once a celebrated child psychologist, believed society was rotting on a diet of screens and endless entertainment. His answer was <strong>Mr HappyFunFace</strong>, a grotesque figure designed to shock children into presence and focus. Branded cruel and dangerous, Vale\u2019s career collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades later, warped by isolation, he has turned his theories into a religion. You are now one of many subjects to be tested in his most extreme and brutally difficult experiment yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/ac2909702f6b69be6d19d0065b6a9964.poster.avif?t=1771341083\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/ac2909702f6b69be6d19d0065b6a9964.webm?t=1771341083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/ac2909702f6b69be6d19d0065b6a9964.mp4?t=1771341083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/91ed5d9afbfd7290217b561ef418e067.avif?t=1771341083\" width=1560 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorise the routes and find the keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock doors to uncover new routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't look at Mr HappyFunFace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the clock - you have only 60 seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, Die, Learn, Repeat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964010/extras/055f4ebc950b44a07b06